  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, when an attack is declared involving
    your face-up monster and an opponent's monster, if you have an \"Odd-Eyes\" card
    in your other Pendulum Zone: You can make that monster you control gain 1200
    ATK until the end of the Battle Phase (even if this card leaves the field).\n\n[
    Monster Effect ] \nWhen this Pendulum Summoned card inflicts battle damage to
    your opponent by attacking: You can inflict damage to your opponent equal to
    the number of \"Odd-Eyes\" cards in your Pendulum Zones x 1200. You can only
    use this effect of \"Odd-Eyes Phantom Dragon\" once per turn."
